{"unit_id":"baisama-cloud__dsh-conflict-guardian#card-zh","repo":"baisama-cloud/dsh-conflict-guardian","commit":"a40d98904be6b16034ec43b3b159a94f8449b806","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conflict-guardian 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件冲突检测插件。它在启动时扫描加载器中的插件实例和组合配置，在运行时处理相同模块与相同配置的重复挂载、启动失败、缺失注入服务和启用但未运行的实例，并检查配置文件中的重复行 id。它会尝试停用冲突实例或恢复未运行实例，并将检测结果通过 Web 路由提供给界面；页面以弹窗展示报告，支持重新检测和关闭。适合需要快速定位 DSH 插件加载问题的用户；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-331","lib/index.js:335-367","lib/client.js:55-105"]}
{"unit_id":"baisama-cloud__dsh-conflict-guardian#card-en","repo":"baisama-cloud/dsh-conflict-guardian","commit":"a40d98904be6b16034ec43b3b159a94f8449b806","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-conflict-guardian scans DSH loader instances and composition rows at startup for duplicate mounts, failed or pending plugins, inactive entries, and duplicate row IDs. It attempts to stop or restore instances and shows a web report with a rescan option. It requires no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-331","lib/index.js:335-367","lib/client.js:55-105"]}
